@startuml Logout Sequence Diagram
title UC04 - Logout

actor "User" as User
boundary "Application Page" as Frontend
participant ":authRoutes" as Routes
participant ":authMiddleware" as AuthMW
participant ":authController" as Controller
participant ":authService" as Service
participant ":User Model" as UserModel
database ":MongoDB" as DB

User -> Frontend: 1. Click "Logout" button
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Frontend: 2. Display confirmation

User -> Frontend: 3. Confirm logout

Frontend -> Routes: 4. POST /api/auth/logout\n(Bearer Token)
activate Routes

Routes -> AuthMW: 5. protect(req, res, next)
activate AuthMW

AuthMW -> AuthMW: 6. Verify JWT token

opt [Invalid token]
    AuthMW --> Routes: 7.1 HTTP 401 Response
    deactivate AuthMW
    Routes --> Frontend: 7.2 JSON Error
    deactivate Routes
    Frontend -> Frontend: 7.3 Remove token from localStorage
    Frontend --> User: 7.4 Redirect to login page
end

AuthMW -> UserModel: 7. findById(decoded.id)
activate UserModel

UserModel -> DB: 8. Query user
activate DB

DB --> UserModel: 9. User document
deactivate DB

UserModel --> AuthMW: 10. User data
deactivate UserModel

AuthMW -> AuthMW: 11. req.user = user

AuthMW --> Routes: 12. next()
deactivate AuthMW

Routes -> Controller: 13. logout(req, res)
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: 14. logout(userId)
activate Service

Service -> UserModel: 15. findByIdAndUpdate(userId, {lastLogout: Date.now()})
activate UserModel

UserModel -> DB: 16. Update user
activate DB

DB --> UserModel: 17. Updated user
deactivate DB

UserModel --> Service: 18. User data
deactivate UserModel

Service --> Controller: 19. Return success message
deactivate Service

Controller --> Routes: 20. HTTP 200 Response
deactivate Controller

Routes --> Frontend: 21. JSON {message: "Logout successful"}
deactivate Routes

Frontend -> Frontend: 22. Remove token from localStorage

Frontend --> User: 23. Redirect to login page
deactivate Frontend

@enduml
